{
  "id": "section-407",
  "title": "在接见共青团八大部分代表时的讲话",
  "level": 0,
  "sourceUrl": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/3-110.htm",
  "html": "<table><tbody><tr><td> -&gt;  -&gt; <a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">1968年汉版《毛泽东思想万岁》</a><hr>\n<b>110)</b>\n\n\n<br>\n<br>\n　　要做一个顶天立地的人，顶天就是能掌握马列主义，站得高，看得远；立地就是有坚实的群众基础，和群众打成一片。<br><br><hr><p><a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/3-109.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">上一页</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">目录</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/3-111.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">下一页</a><br><br></p></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n"
